## Third-party notices

This project is a derivative work and ships third-party assets. The full
notices live with the assets they cover and must be preserved:

- `packages/web/public/licenses/rhine-lab.txt` — RhineLabUI (MIT),
  Copyright (c) 2026 LBEILC. The scene, models, camera trajectory, wave
  equations, extraction/return motion, decryption sequence and typography are
  derived from that project's source.
- `packages/web/public/licenses/rolling-number.txt` — @kitlangton/rolling-number.
- `packages/web/public/fonts/NOTICE.txt` and
  `packages/web/public/fonts/misans-webfont-4.3.1/**/upstream.css.txt` —
  MiSans webfont distribution.
- `packages/web/public/assets/boot-lettering-notice.txt` — boot lettering.

See `packages/web/src/console/VENDOR.md` for the exact upstream commits and a
per-seam description of what was retained versus modified.
